Welcome to @NINJAS_OS_NAME@ @NINJAS_OS_VERSION@ ("@NINJAS_OS_CODENAME@").

This is an experimental Arch-based live image built @NINJAS_BUILD_DATE@.
The desktop session runs as the live user "@NINJAS_LIVE_USER@" (no password,
passwordless sudo). The AI assistant is NOT included in this release.

Useful commands:
  journalctl -b -p warning            kernel/service warnings from this boot
  systemctl status ninjas-live-setup  live user setup service
  systemctl status sddm NetworkManager
  cat /etc/ninjas-os-release          image metadata

